    <string name="settings_mcp_guide_what_title">WHAT IS MCP?</string>
    <string name="settings_mcp_guide_what_body">Model Context Protocol lets Claude Code interact with your physical knob — request approvals, present choices, and send notifications directly to the device.</string>
    <string name="settings_mcp_guide_how_title">HOW TO CONNECT</string>
    <string name="settings_mcp_guide_how_body">1. Enable the MCP server with the toggle above.\n2. Add the server to Claude Code by running the command below in your terminal.\n3. Restart Claude Code.</string>
